<title>UK: Miura sets $100 mln bond with warrants.</title>
<headline>Miura sets $100 mln bond with warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue was announced by lead manager Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MIURA CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     3.875     MATURITY    27.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 WARRANTS  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    27.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	PREMIUM    2.50 PCT</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) *	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.50     PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	*10 PLUS TWO WARRANTS</p>
<p>		EXERCISE PERIOD   - 14.JAN.97-20.DEC.00</p>
<p>		FIXING ON DECEMBER 17</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
